# Lockfiles are derived artifacts — never let git line-merge them into an
# inconsistent state (one that matches neither parent's manifest).
#
# THIS BLOCK MUST STAY BELOW THE MERGIRAF PATTERNS. `merge` is a single
# attribute and git applies the LAST matching pattern, so `*.json
# merge=mergiraf` placed after this would re-enable merging of
# package-lock.json, and `*.yaml` would do the same to pnpm-lock.yaml.
uv.lock          -merge
pnpm-lock.yaml   -merge
package-lock.json -merge
yarn.lock        -merge
Cargo.lock       -merge
poetry.lock      -merge
Gemfile.lock     -merge
go.sum           -merge
go.work.sum      -merge
